            "content": "<p>A complete Vivnook workday set, designed to move with you through long shifts.</p><p><strong>EverTrue™ Scrub Tops</strong></p><ul><li>Clean, modern silhouette</li><li>Four-way stretch</li></ul><p><strong>EverTrue™ Scrub Pants</strong></p><ul><li>High-stretch knit waistband</li><li>No drawstring</li><li>Straight-leg fit</li><li>Two front pockets, one side cargo pocket and one back pocket</li></ul><p><strong>Fanny Pack</strong></p><ul><li>12-slot organization system</li><li>Magnetic quick-release buckle</li><li>Adjustable for waist or crossbody wear</li></ul>",
