            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p><strong>EverTrue™ Scrub Tops & EverTrue™ Scrub Pants</strong></p><p>Body: 89% Polyester, 11%&nbsp;</p><p>Spandex</p><p><strong>Pants Contrast Fabric</strong></p><p>50% Rayon, 45% Nylon, 5% Spandex</p><p><strong>Fanny Pack</strong></p><p>Shell: Water-resistant nylon</p><p>Lining: Ripstop polyester</p><p>Capacity: 1.5L</p><p>Dimensions: 23×13×5cm</p><p>Adjustable belt: 58–113cm</p><p><strong>Care — Scrubs</strong></p><p>Machine wash warm, inside out, with like colors. Tumble dry low. Low heat iron if needed. Do not bleach or dry clean. Do not iron directly on embroidery.</p>",
