            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p><strong>Shipping</strong></p><ul><li>Free standard shipping on orders over US$100.</li><li>Standard orders are processed within 1–3 business days. Custom and embroidered orders require an additional 5–10 business days.</li><li>Estimated delivery after dispatch: US 7–12, Australia 8–12, Europe 6–12, Asia 3–5 business days.</li></ul><p><strong>Returns</strong></p><ul><li>Return requests are reviewed case by case. Please contact <a href=\"mailto:support@vivnook.com\">support@vivnook.com</a> before sending items back.</li><li>Embroidered or altered items are not eligible for change-of-mind returns, subject to applicable law.</li></ul><p><strong>Duties & Taxes</strong></p><p>Applicable taxes are shown at checkout where required. Vivnook covers applicable customs duties and import charges.</p><p>See our full Shipping & Returns Policy for details.</p>",
